    <section class="slide soft" id="scope">
<div class="wrap ref-section">
  <div class="ref-scope-layout">
    <div class="ref-scope-story">
      <span class="ref-kicker">PM Scope</span>
      <h2>Product management<br />across strategy,<br /><span>systems and execution.</span></h2>
      <p>End-to-end ownership from problem discovery and requirements to solution design, build, deployment and continuous improvement, across multiple stakeholders, systems and regulated environments.</p>
      <div class="ref-scope-mini">
        <div class="ref-scope-mini-item">
          <span class="ref-scope-mini-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="23" height="23" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3"></circle><circle cx="17" cy="9" r="2.5"></circle><path d="M3 21v-1a6 6 0 0 1 12 0v1m1-5a5 5 0 0 1 5 5"></path></svg></span>
          <div><strong>Business & Customer</strong><span>Needs & Outcomes</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="ref-scope-mini-item">
          <span class="ref-scope-mini-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="23" height="23" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10" cy="12" r="7"></circle><circle cx="10" cy="12" r="3"></circle><path d="m10 12 9-9m-4 0h4v4"></path></svg></span>
          <div><strong>Strategy & Planning</strong><span>Vision & Roadmap</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="ref-scope-wheel" aria-label="Eight product management stages">
        <div class="ref-scope-core">Product<br />Management</div>
        <div class="ref-wheel-node discover"><span>⌕</span><b>01<br />Discover</b></div>
        <div class="ref-wheel-node define"><span>▤</span><b>02<br />Define</b></div>
        <div class="ref-wheel-node design"><span>▣</span><b>03<br />Design</b></div>
        <div class="ref-wheel-node architect"><span>⌘</span><b>04<br />Architect</b></div>
        <div class="ref-wheel-node automate"><span>⚙</span><b>05<br />Automate</b></div>
        <div class="ref-wheel-node ai"><span>✦</span><b>06<br />AI / GenAI</b></div>
        <div class="ref-wheel-node deliver"><span>➤</span><b>07<br />Deliver</b></div>
        <div class="ref-wheel-node scale"><span>▥</span><b>08<br />Scale & Adopt</b></div>
      </div>
      <div class="ref-scope-foot">FROM IDEAS AND REQUIREMENTS TO REAL-WORLD IMPACT</div>
    </div>
    <div class="ref-scope-grid">
      <article class="ref-scope-card blue">
        <div class="ref-card-head"><span class="ref-num">01</span><div class="ref-card-title-wrap"><span class="ref-card-label">INSIGHTS</span><h3 class="ref-card-title">Discover</h3><p class="ref-card-desc">Understand customer needs, business problems and opportunities.</p></div></div>
        <div class="ref-scope-art"><div class="sheet"></div><div class="bubble"></div><div class="pen"></div></div>
        <ul class="ref-scope-bullets"><li>Stakeholder interviews & workshops</li><li>Process mapping & current state analysis</li><li>Market and user research</li><li>Identify problem statements & opportunities</li></ul>
        <div class="ref-output"><strong>KEY OUTPUTS:</strong>Problem statement, user insights, process maps, opportunity assessment</div>
      </article>
      <article class="ref-scope-card purple">
        <div class="ref-card-head"><span class="ref-num">02</span><div class="ref-card-title-wrap"><span class="ref-card-label">REQUIREMENTS</span><h3 class="ref-card-title">Define</h3><p class="ref-card-desc">Translate insights into clear requirements and acceptance criteria.</p></div></div>
        <div class="ref-scope-art"><div class="sheet"></div><div class="bubble"></div><div class="pen"></div></div>
        <ul class="ref-scope-bullets"><li>BRD, FRD, FSD and user stories</li><li>Functional & non-functional requirements</li><li>Acceptance criteria and use cases</li><li>Stakeholder alignment & sign-offs</li></ul>
        <div class="ref-output"><strong>KEY OUTPUTS:</strong>BRD / FRD / FSD, user stories, acceptance criteria, prioritization (MoSCoW)</div>
      </article>
      <article class="ref-scope-card green">
        <div class="ref-card-head"><span class="ref-num">03</span><div class="ref-card-title-wrap"><span class="ref-card-label">SOLUTION DESIGN</span><h3 class="ref-card-title">Design</h3><p class="ref-card-desc">Create user-centric designs and product workflows aligned to business goals.</p></div></div>
        <div class="ref-scope-art"><div class="sheet"></div><div class="bubble"></div><div class="pen"></div></div>
        <ul class="ref-scope-bullets"><li>User journeys and process flows</li><li>Figma prototypes and UX design</li><li>Workflow and rules design</li><li>Feature specifications</li></ul>
        <div class="ref-output"><strong>KEY OUTPUTS:</strong>Figma designs, user journeys, workflow diagrams, feature specs</div>
      </article>
      <article class="ref-scope-card amber">
        <div class="ref-card-head"><span class="ref-num">04</span><div class="ref-card-title-wrap"><span class="ref-card-label">TECHNICAL ARCHITECTURE</span><h3 class="ref-card-title">Architect</h3><p class="ref-card-desc">Design scalable, secure and integration-ready solutions.</p></div></div>
        <div class="ref-scope-art"><div class="sheet"></div><div class="bubble"></div><div class="pen"></div></div>
        <ul class="ref-scope-bullets"><li>System architecture and DFDs</li><li>ER models and data mapping</li><li>API contracts and integrations</li><li>Security, compliance and scalability</li></ul>
        <div class="ref-output"><strong>KEY OUTPUTS:</strong>Architecture diagrams, DFD, ER model, API specs, integration design, compliance controls</div>
      </article>
      <article class="ref-scope-card pink">
        <div class="ref-card-head"><span class="ref-num">05</span><div class="ref-card-title-wrap"><span class="ref-card-label">WORKFLOWS & CONTROLS</span><h3 class="ref-card-title">Automate</h3><p class="ref-card-desc">Implement automation, rules and controls to reduce manual effort and improve accuracy.</p></div></div>
        <div class="ref-scope-art"><div class="sheet"></div><div class="bubble"></div><div class="pen"></div></div>
        <ul class="ref-scope-bullets"><li>Rules engine and approval workflows</li><li>Exception handling and alerts</li><li>Reconciliation and compliance automation</li><li>Operational dashboards</li></ul>
        <div class="ref-output"><strong>KEY OUTPUTS:</strong>Automated workflows, rules, alerts, reconciliation logic, operational dashboards</div>
      </article>
      <article class="ref-scope-card cyan">
        <div class="ref-card-head"><span class="ref-num">06</span><div class="ref-card-title-wrap"><span class="ref-card-label">INTELLIGENCE</span><h3 class="ref-card-title">AI / GenAI</h3><p class="ref-card-desc">Enable AI-driven decisioning, document intelligence and knowledge workflows.</p></div></div>
        <div class="ref-scope-art"><div class="sheet"></div><div class="bubble"></div><div class="pen"></div></div>
        <ul class="ref-scope-bullets"><li>AI-assisted decisioning and risk profiling</li><li>Document intelligence (IDP)</li><li>GenAI for knowledge search and summarization</li><li>Process intelligence and optimization</li></ul>
        <div class="ref-output"><strong>KEY OUTPUTS:</strong>AI models, document AI workflows, GenAI features, intelligent recommendations</div>
      </article>
      <article class="ref-scope-card violet">
        <div class="ref-card-head"><span class="ref-num">07</span><div class="ref-card-title-wrap"><span class="ref-card-label">EXECUTION</span><h3 class="ref-card-title">Deliver</h3><p class="ref-card-desc">Drive development, testing and deployment across teams and environments.</p></div></div>
        <div class="ref-scope-art"><div class="sheet"></div><div class="bubble"></div><div class="pen"></div></div>
        <ul class="ref-scope-bullets"><li>Backlog grooming and sprint planning</li><li>JIRA and Agile execution</li><li>QA, UAT, VAPT and release management</li><li>Stakeholder demos and training</li></ul>
        <div class="ref-output"><strong>KEY OUTPUTS:</strong>Working product, UAT sign-off, release notes, training and handover</div>
      </article>
      <article class="ref-scope-card mint">
        <div class="ref-card-head"><span class="ref-num">08</span><div class="ref-card-title-wrap"><span class="ref-card-label">ADOPTION & IMPACT</span><h3 class="ref-card-title">Scale & Adopt</h3><p class="ref-card-desc">Drive adoption, measure outcomes and continuously improve.</p></div></div>
        <div class="ref-scope-art"><div class="sheet"></div><div class="bubble"></div><div class="pen"></div></div>
        <ul class="ref-scope-bullets"><li>Production rollout and user training</li><li>Change management and L1/L2 support</li><li>Usage tracking and product metrics</li><li>Continuous feedback and enhancement</li></ul>
        <div class="ref-output"><strong>KEY OUTPUTS:</strong>Adoption metrics, business impact, feedback loop, roadmap for next phase</div>
      </article></div></div></div>
    </section>

