    <section class="slide soft" id="metrics">
<div class="wrap ref-section"><div class="ref-metrics-layout"><div class="ref-metrics-story"><span class="ref-kicker">Product Metrics</span><h2>Measure the product,<br><span>not just the release.</span></h2><p>I use product metrics to connect activity to adoption, efficiency, quality, control and business impact. Metrics help measure outcomes across the entire product lifecycle, from user adoption and workflow behavior to operational efficiency and business value.</p><div class="ref-metric-questions"><div class="ref-metric-q"><div class="qicon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="23" height="23" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3"></circle><circle cx="17" cy="9" r="2.5"></circle><path d="M3 21v-1a6 6 0 0 1 12 0v1m1-5a5 5 0 0 1 5 5"></path></svg></div>Users<span>Who is using<br>the product?</span></div><div class="ref-metric-q"><div class="qicon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="23" height="23" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M4 20V9m6 11V4m6 16v-7m6 7H2"></path><path d="m4 7 6-4 6 7 6-5"></path></svg></div>Behavior<span>How are they<br>using it?</span></div><div class="ref-metric-q"><div class="qicon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="23" height="23" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="m12 2 2 2.5 3-.5.5 3 2.5 2-1 3 1 3-2.5 2-.5 3-3-.5L12 22l-2.5-2.5-3 .5-.5-3L3.5 15l1-3-1-3L6 7l.5-3 3 .5z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg></div>Efficiency<span>Is it reducing<br>effort?</span></div><div class="ref-metric-q"><div class="qicon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="23" height="23" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><circle cx="10" cy="12" r="7"></circle><circle cx="10" cy="12" r="3"></circle><path d="m10 12 9-9m-4 0h4v4"></path></svg></div>Business Impact<span>Is it creating<br>measurable value?</span></div></div><div class="ref-chart"><svg viewBox="0 0 500 180" fill="none"><g opacity=".28" stroke="#7ca6ce"><path d="M10 160H420"></path><path d="M10 130H420"></path><path d="M10 100H420"></path><path d="M10 70H420"></path></g><g opacity=".18" fill="#3b8de8"><rect x="18" y="118" width="24" height="42" rx="7"></rect><rect x="60" y="105" width="24" height="55" rx="7"></rect><rect x="102" y="92" width="24" height="68" rx="7"></rect><rect x="144" y="72" width="24" height="88" rx="7"></rect><rect x="186" y="83" width="24" height="77" rx="7"></rect><rect x="228" y="58" width="24" height="102" rx="7"></rect><rect x="270" y="48" width="24" height="112" rx="7"></rect><rect x="312" y="31" width="24" height="129" rx="7"></rect><rect x="354" y="22" width="24" height="138" rx="7"></rect></g><path d="M10 133 C70 150,90 130,145 105 S230 110,285 75 S360 80,420 35" stroke="#13baf0" stroke-width="4"></path><path d="M10 125 C70 120,95 118,145 100 S230 82,285 55 S360 38,420 14" stroke="#ff9e18" stroke-width="4"></path><path d="M10 145 C65 160,110 142,150 125 S225 118,285 96 S360 80,420 68" stroke="#399ef5" stroke-width="4"></path><circle cx="420" cy="35" r="5" fill="#ff9e18"></circle><circle cx="420" cy="68" r="5" fill="#399ef5"></circle></svg><div class="ref-chart-labels"><span>Adoption</span><span>Efficiency</span><span>Business Impact</span></div></div><div class="ref-metric-bottom"><div><strong>North-star metric</strong><span>Adoption → Usage → Workflow Behavior → Operational Efficiency → Business Outcome</span></div><div><strong>Goal</strong><span>Data-driven decisions for continuous improvement</span></div></div></div><div><div class="ref-metric-grid">
      <article class="ref-metric-card users">
        <div class="ref-metric-card-head"><div class="ref-metric-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="23" height="23" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3"></circle><circle cx="17" cy="9" r="2.5"></circle><path d="M3 21v-1a6 6 0 0 1 12 0v1m1-5a5 5 0 0 1 5 5"></path></svg></div><div><span class="ref-metric-num">01</span><span class="ref-metric-name">Adoption</span><p class="ref-metric-question">Are the intended users actually using the product?</p></div></div>
        <ul class="ref-metric-list"><li>Eligible user adoption (%)</li><li>Active users (DAU / MAU)</li><li>Workflow completion rate</li><li>Feature adoption by module</li></ul>
        <div class="ref-donut"><span>78%</span></div><div class="ref-donut-label">↑ 12%<em>blue</em></div>
      </article>
      <article class="ref-metric-card rocket">
        <div class="ref-metric-card-head"><div class="ref-metric-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="23" height="23" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 4c2.5-1.5 5.5-1.5 6-1.5 0 .5 0 3.5-1.5 6L12 15l-4-4z"></path><path d="m8 11-3 1-2 4 6-1m2 0-1 5 4-3 1-3"></path><circle cx="16" cy="7" r="1.5"></circle></svg></div><div><span class="ref-metric-num">02</span><span class="ref-metric-name">Activation</span><p class="ref-metric-question">How quickly does a user reach meaningful value?</p></div></div>
        <ul class="ref-metric-list"><li>Time to first value</li><li>Onboarding completion rate</li><li>Feature activation rate</li><li>User journey drop-off rate</li></ul>
        <div class="ref-donut"><span>62%</span></div><div class="ref-donut-label">↑ 18%<em>purple</em></div>
      </article>
      <article class="ref-metric-card gear">
        <div class="ref-metric-card-head"><div class="ref-metric-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="23" height="23" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 3 2 2.5 3-.5.5 3L20 9l-1 3 1 3-2.5 1.5-.5 3-3-.5-2 2-2-2-3 .5-.5-3L4 15l1-3-1-3 2.5-1.5.5-3 3 .5z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg></div><div><span class="ref-metric-num">03</span><span class="ref-metric-name">Efficiency</span><p class="ref-metric-question">Does the product remove time, effort or manual work?</p></div></div>
        <ul class="ref-metric-list"><li>Turnaround time reduction</li><li>Manual effort saved (hours)</li><li>Automation rate (%)</li><li>Cost per transaction/process</li></ul>
        <div class="ref-donut"><span>45%</span></div><div class="ref-donut-label">↑ 25%<em>green</em></div>
      </article>
      <article class="ref-metric-card shield">
        <div class="ref-metric-card-head"><div class="ref-metric-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="23" height="23" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2 21 6v6c0 5-3.8 8.5-9 10-5.2-1.5-9-5-9-10V6z"></path><path d="m8 12 2.5 2.5L16 9"></path></svg></div><div><span class="ref-metric-num">04</span><span class="ref-metric-name">Quality & Risk</span><p class="ref-metric-question">Does the product make the process more reliable and controlled?</p></div></div>
        <ul class="ref-metric-list"><li>Error / exception rate</li><li>Reconciliation breaks (%)</li><li>SLA / TAT adherence</li><li>Audit readiness & control effectiveness</li></ul>
        <div class="ref-donut"><span>90%</span></div><div class="ref-donut-label">↑ 20%<em>amber</em></div>
      </article>
      <article class="ref-metric-card ai">
        <div class="ref-metric-card-head"><div class="ref-metric-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="23" height="23" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="7" width="16" height="12" rx="3"></rect><path d="M12 3v4M8 12h.1m7.8 0h.1M9 16h6M2 11v4m20-4v4"></path><circle cx="12" cy="4" r="1"></circle></svg></div><div><span class="ref-metric-num">05</span><span class="ref-metric-name">AI & Automation</span><p class="ref-metric-question">Is intelligence improving the workflow without losing control?</p></div></div>
        <ul class="ref-metric-list"><li>AI assist usage rate</li><li>Straight-through processing rate</li><li>Document processing accuracy</li><li>Human hand-off reduction</li></ul>
        <div class="ref-donut"><span>68%</span></div><div class="ref-donut-label">↑ 30%<em>pink</em></div>
      </article>
      <article class="ref-metric-card chart">
        <div class="ref-metric-card-head"><div class="ref-metric-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="23" height="23" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 20V10m5 10V4m5 16v-7m5 7H2"></path><path d="m4 7 5-3 5 5 5-4"></path></svg></div><div><span class="ref-metric-num">06</span><span class="ref-metric-name">Business Impact</span><p class="ref-metric-question">Did the product change a meaningful business outcome?</p></div></div>
        <ul class="ref-metric-list"><li>Cost reduction (%)</li><li>Productivity gain (%)</li><li>Revenue / service impact</li><li>Customer / stakeholder satisfaction</li></ul>
        <div class="ref-donut"><span>32%</span></div><div class="ref-donut-label">↑ 40%<em>mint</em></div>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="ref-formulas">
      <div class="ref-formula-title">KEY METRIC<br />FORMULAS</div>
      <div class="ref-formula"><strong>Adoption rate</strong><span>Active eligible users ÷ total eligible users × 100</span></div>
      <div class="ref-formula"><strong>Activation rate</strong><span>Users reaching first value ÷ eligible users × 100</span></div>
      <div class="ref-formula"><strong>Efficiency gain</strong><span>(Baseline effort − Current effort) ÷ Baseline effort × 100</span></div>
      <div class="ref-formula"><strong>Automation rate</strong><span>Automated cases ÷ Total eligible cases × 100</span></div>
      <div class="ref-formula"><strong>Exception rate</strong><span>Exception cases ÷ Total processed cases × 100</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="ref-outcome-legend" style="margin-top:10px">
      <strong>METRIC CATEGORIES</strong>
      <div class="ref-legend-item"><b>Adoption & Usage</b>Users, activation, journeys</div>
      <div class="ref-legend-item"><b>Operational Efficiency</b>Time, effort, automation</div>
      <div class="ref-legend-item"><b>Quality & Risk</b>Control, compliance, SLA</div>
      <div class="ref-legend-item"><b>Business Impact</b>Cost, productivity, revenue</div>
      <div class="ref-legend-item"><b>AI & Automation</b>Intelligence, STP, accuracy</div>
    </div>
